WEBVTT

00:07.421 --> 00:08.732
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.801 --> 00:10.389
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.458 --> 00:11.908
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:11.977 --> 00:14.014
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.083 --> 00:16.982
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.051 --> 00:19.019
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.088 --> 00:21.090
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.159 --> 00:22.919
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:22.988 --> 00:24.886
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.955 --> 00:27.061
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.130 --> 00:29.132
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.201 --> 00:31.076
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.100 --> 00:33.033
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.102 --> 00:34.827
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:34.896 --> 00:37.175
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.244 --> 00:39.108
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.177 --> 00:40.385
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.454 --> 00:42.283
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.352 --> 00:45.045
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.114 --> 00:47.288
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.357 --> 00:48.738
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.360 --> 00:53.260
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:53.329 --> 01:00.163
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:00.232 --> 01:03.339
- And now
"The Jellyson Group."
- 现在
“杰利森集团。”

01:03.408 --> 01:07.757
- Good evening and welcome
to "The Jellyson Group,"
- 晚上好，欢迎光临
到“杰利森集团”，

01:07.826 --> 01:12.831
Bikini Bottom's best and
only show about jellyfishing.
比基尼泳裤最好的和
只展示有关水母的内容。

01:12.900 --> 01:15.420
My guests tonight
are jellyfishing fashion
今晚我的客人
是水母时尚

01:15.489 --> 01:17.180
journalist Fabrica Olay.
记者法布里卡·欧莱。

01:17.249 --> 01:18.181
- [slurps]
- [啜饮]

01:18.250 --> 01:19.665
Hmph.
哼。

01:19.734 --> 01:22.358
- Famed jellyfish
juggler Fish-O The Clown.
- 著名的水母
杂耍者 Fish-O 小丑。

01:22.427 --> 01:23.704
[honks horn]
[按喇叭]

01:23.773 --> 01:25.015
Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。嗯嗯。

01:25.085 --> 01:29.296
And something
called a SpongeBob.
还有一些东西
称为海绵宝宝。

01:29.365 --> 01:30.814
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

01:30.883 --> 01:35.095
- Tonight we will be discussing
the moon jellyfish.
- 今晚我们将讨论
月亮水母。

01:35.164 --> 01:40.238
Only seen once every 25
years, will soon be migrating
每 25 只出现一次
年，很快就会迁移

01:40.307 --> 01:42.136
through Bikini Bottom.
通过比基尼底部。

01:42.205 --> 01:44.863
- If I can just interrupt,
there's no evidence
- 如果我能打断的话
没有证据

01:44.932 --> 01:46.899
this jellyfish even exists.
这种水母甚至存在。

01:46.968 --> 01:50.075
Has anyone seen it,
much less caught it?
有谁看过吗，
更何况抓到了呢？

01:50.144 --> 01:52.319
- Kevin C. Cucumber,
the greatest
- 凯文·C·黄瓜，
最伟大的

01:52.388 --> 01:55.839
jellyfisher who ever lived,
caught the moon jellyfish.
曾经生活过的水母，
捕获了月亮水母。

01:55.908 --> 01:59.015
Roll his famous
moon catching clip.
滚他著名的
捕捉月亮的剪辑。

01:59.084 --> 02:00.430
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:00.499 --> 02:01.638
I caught it!
我抓住了！

02:01.707 --> 02:04.193
I caught the moon jellyfish!
我抓到了月亮水母！

02:04.262 --> 02:07.782
I love jellyfishing!
我喜欢捉水母！

02:07.851 --> 02:09.922
- That video is a fake.
- 那个视频是假的。

02:09.991 --> 02:11.476
- Well, it looked real to me.
- 嗯，对我来说它看起来很真实。

02:11.545 --> 02:12.994
[horn honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

02:13.063 --> 02:14.743
That fish is real...
- It's a fake! A ruse!
那条鱼是真的……
- 这是假的！诡计！

02:14.789 --> 02:15.652
- You big-shoed buffoon.
- Anyone could see it.
- 你这个大鞋小丑。
- 任何人都可以看到它。

02:15.721 --> 02:17.102
- The moon jellyfish is a fact.
- 月亮水母是事实。

02:17.171 --> 02:18.931
- Stop!
- 停止！

02:19.000 --> 02:21.693
It's not fake, and I'll prove
it to you by catching the moon
这不是假的，我会证明的
抓住月亮给你

02:21.762 --> 02:24.937
jellyfish just like Kevin did.
像凯文一样的水母。

02:25.006 --> 02:27.906
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:27.975 --> 02:29.701
What did I tell you, Gary?
我告诉你什么了，加里？

02:29.770 --> 02:31.806
Maybe if I can get
Kevin to help me,
也许如果我能得到
凯文来帮助我，

02:31.875 --> 02:34.257
I'll have a chance to
catch that moon jellyfish.
我将有机会
抓住那只月亮水母。

02:34.326 --> 02:37.226
And I know just
where to find Kevin.
我知道只是
哪里可以找到凯文.

02:38.503 --> 02:42.576
At the Jellyspotters Clubhouse.
在 Jellyspotters 俱乐部会所。

02:42.645 --> 02:47.201
Ooh.
哦。

02:47.270 --> 02:51.240
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

02:51.309 --> 02:53.069
- Meep.
- 米普。

02:53.138 --> 02:54.450
Meep meep.
米普米普。

02:54.519 --> 02:55.520
- Hello.
- 你好。

02:55.589 --> 02:56.486
I'm looking for...
我在找...

02:56.555 --> 03:00.628
- Meep.
- 米普。

03:00.697 --> 03:03.804
Meep.
米普。

03:03.873 --> 03:06.496
[regal music]
[富丽堂皇的音乐]

03:06.565 --> 03:09.258
- Kevin, is it really you?
- 凯文，真的是你吗？

03:09.327 --> 03:11.052
I'm not worthy.
我不值得。

03:12.468 --> 03:14.677
- Hey there, Not Worthy.
- 嘿，不值得。

03:14.746 --> 03:16.230
I'm Patrick.
我是帕特里克。

03:16.299 --> 03:17.507
- Patrick?
- 帕特里克？

03:17.576 --> 03:19.544
You're the president
of the Jellyspotters Club?
你是总统
Jellyspotters 俱乐部的成员？

03:19.613 --> 03:21.270
- Sure am.
- 当然是。

03:21.339 --> 03:25.343
We drew straws, and I was the
first one to eat them all.
我们抽了稻草，我就是那个
第一个把它们全部吃掉的人。

03:25.412 --> 03:26.585
- That's great.
- 那太棒了。

03:26.654 --> 03:29.105
Is Kevin Cucumber here?
凯文·黄瓜在吗？

03:29.174 --> 03:32.212
- You mean the guy that
looks like a nerdy pickle?
- 你是说那个人
看起来像一个书呆子泡菜？

03:32.281 --> 03:35.145
He got kicked out
of the club years
他被赶出了家门
俱乐部年数

03:35.215 --> 03:38.735
ago and mysteriously
disappeared.
以前和神秘地
消失了。

03:38.804 --> 03:43.326
No one knows where he is.
没有人知道他在哪里。

03:43.395 --> 03:45.052
Huh?
啊？

03:45.121 --> 03:47.744
But if you want to find him,
here's his current address.
但如果你想找到他
这是他现在的地址。

03:55.545 --> 03:59.687
- 123 Shack in the Woods Lane.
- 林巷小屋 123 号。

03:59.756 --> 04:01.206
Thank you, Patrick.
谢谢你，帕特里克。

04:01.275 --> 04:07.523
- That's President
Patrick to you, Sonny Jim.
- 那是总统
帕特里克给你，桑尼·吉姆。

04:07.592 --> 04:12.493
Can I get a refill on these?
我可以补充这些吗？

04:12.562 --> 04:14.599
- Well, these are the woods,
- 嗯，这些是树林，

04:14.668 --> 04:16.842
and this is the only lane I see.
这是我看到的唯一的车道。

04:16.911 --> 04:19.880
[thunder booming]
[雷霆轰鸣]

04:19.949 --> 04:21.675
This must be the place.
一定是这个地方。

04:23.366 --> 04:26.024
Uh... oh!
呃……哦！

04:27.508 --> 04:29.441
Hello?
你好？

04:29.510 --> 04:30.442
Kevin?
凯文？

04:30.511 --> 04:33.583
You here?
你在这里？

04:33.652 --> 04:35.136
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:38.105 --> 04:40.107
Oh, phew.
哦，唷。

04:40.176 --> 04:41.419
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:41.488 --> 04:43.283
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

04:43.352 --> 04:44.939
- [sneezes]
- [打喷嚏]

04:45.008 --> 04:49.185
- Time for walkies,
Miss Marigold.
- 步行时间，
玛丽戈尔德小姐。

04:49.254 --> 04:50.290
Huh?
啊？

04:50.359 --> 04:52.292
- Um, uh...
- 嗯，呃...

04:52.361 --> 04:53.361
hello, ma'am.
你好，女士。

04:53.396 --> 04:55.571
I'm looking for
Kevin C. Cucumber.
我正在寻找
凯文·C·黄瓜。

04:55.640 --> 04:57.262
Have you seen him?
你见过他吗？

04:57.331 --> 04:59.747
- Eh, uh...
- 呃，呃...

04:59.816 --> 05:01.370
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

05:01.439 --> 05:03.095
- Ahh!
- 啊！

05:03.164 --> 05:04.407
Oh, Kevin?
哦，凯文？

05:04.476 --> 05:06.202
- SpongeBob?
- 海绵宝宝？

05:06.271 --> 05:07.755
- Kevin!
- 凯文！

05:07.824 --> 05:11.863
- What are you doing here at
my secret forest shame hole?
- 你在这儿做什么
我的秘密森林耻辱洞？

05:11.932 --> 05:13.416
- Looking for you, silly.
- 正在找你，傻瓜。

05:13.485 --> 05:15.763
I need some moon
jellyfish-catching tips
我需要一些月亮
捕捉水母的技巧

05:15.832 --> 05:17.282
from the master.
来自大师。

05:17.351 --> 05:18.387
- Master?
- 掌握？

05:18.456 --> 05:19.905
Ha!
哈!

05:19.974 --> 05:22.080
I've lost any skills
I might have once had.
我失去了任何技能
我可能曾经有过。

05:22.149 --> 05:24.393
I don't remember how to
catch a regular jelly.
我不记得怎么做
抓住普通的果冻。

05:24.462 --> 05:27.672
I don't even remember
how to catch a cold.
我什至不记得了
如何感冒。

05:27.741 --> 05:31.917
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

05:34.920 --> 05:36.474
- Well, don't worry, Kevin.
- 好吧，别担心，凯文。

05:36.543 --> 05:38.130
I can get you back in shape.
我可以让你恢复体形。

05:38.199 --> 05:39.960
Then we can catch
the moon jelly,
然后我们就可以抓住
月光果冻，

05:40.029 --> 05:42.203
and then you'll be on top again.
然后你就会再次登顶。

05:42.272 --> 05:43.343
- [blows nose]
- [擤鼻子]

05:43.412 --> 05:44.965
- Just like the old days.
- 就像过去一样。

05:45.034 --> 05:48.417
- You think so?
- 你这么认为吗？

05:48.486 --> 05:50.419
It's worth a try.
值得一试。

05:50.488 --> 05:51.834
Thanks, SpongeBob.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

05:51.903 --> 05:55.147
This is the best day
I've had in years.
这是最好的一天
我已经有很多年了。

05:58.944 --> 06:01.775
- Um, maybe we'll
clean you up first.
- 嗯，也许我们会
先把你清理干净。

06:01.844 --> 06:04.709
Hmm.
唔。

06:04.778 --> 06:07.884
[razor buzzing]
[剃须刀嗡嗡声]

06:20.656 --> 06:23.935
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:29.837 --> 06:33.289
- Kevin is back, baby.
- 凯文回来了，宝贝。

06:37.776 --> 06:39.537
- Now that you're
looking the part,
- 现在你是
寻找零件，

06:39.606 --> 06:42.747
let's shake the rust off those
jellyfishing skills, shall we?
让我们把那些铁锈抖掉
捕水母技能，可以吗？

06:42.816 --> 06:43.817
- Hmm.
- 唔。

06:43.886 --> 06:45.715
[jellyfish buzzing]
[水母嗡嗡声]

06:45.784 --> 06:47.372
[laughs]
[笑]

06:47.441 --> 06:50.133
[yells]
[喊叫]

06:50.202 --> 06:51.514
[jellyfish zapping]
[水母的攻击]

06:51.583 --> 06:52.791
- Ooh.
- 哦。

06:52.860 --> 06:56.519
Maybe we'll start with
something a little easier.
也许我们会从
一些更容易的事情。

06:56.588 --> 06:58.038
[jellyfish cooing]
[水母咕咕叫]

06:58.107 --> 07:01.904
Jelly babies.
果冻宝宝们。

07:06.943 --> 07:09.049
[jellyfish zapping]
[水母的攻击]

07:09.118 --> 07:12.362
OK, maybe something
a lot easier.
好吧，也许有什么
容易多了。

07:12.432 --> 07:14.813
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

07:14.882 --> 07:16.194
Now, go ahead, Kevin.
现在，继续吧，凯文。

07:16.263 --> 07:18.748
Ow!
Take your... ow! best swing.
噢！
带上你的……噢！最好的挥杆。

07:18.817 --> 07:22.925
- Mm-hmm.
- 嗯嗯。

07:22.994 --> 07:23.995
I did it!
我做到了！

07:24.064 --> 07:26.135
I'm a jellyfisher again!
我又变回水母了！

07:26.204 --> 07:29.345
[laughs]
[笑]

07:34.937 --> 07:37.077
- OK, now for the real deal.
- 好吧，现在开始真正的交易了。

07:37.146 --> 07:40.770
What's step one in catching
the moon jellyfish?
捕捉的第一步是什么
月亮水母？

07:40.839 --> 07:43.393
- Uh, I know this one.
- 呃，我知道这个。

07:43.463 --> 07:46.293
Wait for the moon
to come out so we can see it.
等月亮
出来让我们可以看到它。

07:46.362 --> 07:47.156
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

07:47.225 --> 07:51.678
- Ooh, good step one.
- 哦，第一步很好。

07:51.747 --> 07:52.679
Here it comes.
它来了。

07:52.748 --> 07:53.749
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

07:53.818 --> 07:56.717
[mystical music]
[神秘音乐]

07:56.786 --> 07:59.651
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:59.720 --> 08:03.344
[jellyfish humming]
[水母嗡嗡声]

08:04.691 --> 08:07.245
Ah!
啊!

08:07.314 --> 08:10.593
OK, Kevin, what's step two?
好的，凯文，第二步是什么？

08:10.662 --> 08:11.662
Kevin?
凯文？

08:11.698 --> 08:14.597
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

08:22.225 --> 08:25.263
- Tire the moon jelly out
by getting it to chase us.
- 让月亮果冻疲惫不堪
让它追我们。

08:25.332 --> 08:27.265
That must be step two, huh?
这一定是第二步，对吧？

08:27.334 --> 08:29.405
- There is no step two.
- 没有第二步。

08:29.474 --> 08:33.236
I don't know how to
catch a moon jellyfish.
我不知道该怎么做
捕获月亮水母。

08:33.305 --> 08:36.239
I faked the moon
catching on a soundstage
我伪造了月亮
赶上音场

08:36.308 --> 08:39.553
so people would
think I was cool.
所以人们会
觉得我很酷。

08:39.622 --> 08:41.659
I got it.
我得到了它。

08:41.728 --> 08:43.315
Aw.
噢。

08:43.384 --> 08:46.526
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

08:46.595 --> 08:51.669
- This is your chance
to catch it and really be cool.
- 这是你的机会
抓住它，真的很酷。

08:51.738 --> 08:56.294
Quick, in here.
快点，到这里。

08:56.363 --> 08:58.572
Our best bet is to surround it.
我们最好的选择就是包围它。

08:58.641 --> 08:59.641
You go left.
你向左走。

08:59.677 --> 09:00.677
I'll go right.
我就往右走。

09:00.712 --> 09:02.093
We'll catch it between us.
我们会在我们之间抓住它。

09:02.162 --> 09:06.200
And remember, stealth is key.
请记住，隐身是关键。

09:07.477 --> 09:08.513
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

09:08.582 --> 09:09.514
- Huh?
Ahh!
- 啊？
啊！

09:09.583 --> 09:12.724
[both shouting]
[两人大喊]

09:16.141 --> 09:17.418
[sirens wailing]
[警笛哀嚎]

09:17.487 --> 09:20.352
- Some of us work
in the morning.
- 我们中的一些人工作
早上。

09:20.421 --> 09:22.078
Come on!
快点！

09:22.147 --> 09:24.046
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

09:24.115 --> 09:26.427
all: Hey,
it's the moon jellyfish.
全体：嘿，
这是月亮水母。

09:26.496 --> 09:27.843
Look at that.
看看那个。

09:27.912 --> 09:29.810
[cheering]
[欢呼]

09:29.879 --> 09:34.366
[jellyfish buzzing]
[水母嗡嗡声]

09:34.435 --> 09:36.127
- I don't think
we're going to catch up
- 我不认为
我们会赶上的

09:36.196 --> 09:38.681
to that jellyfish, SpongeBob.
到那个水母，海绵宝宝。

09:38.750 --> 09:40.856
My knees are getting tired.
我的膝盖越来越累了。

09:40.925 --> 09:43.410
[knee yawns]
[膝盖打呵欠]

09:43.479 --> 09:46.068
- If we can't outrun it,
maybe we can trap it.
- 如果我们无法超越它
也许我们可以困住它。

09:46.137 --> 09:48.104
But we'll need some bait.
但我们需要一些诱饵。

09:48.173 --> 09:51.211
What would a moon
jellyfish like to eat?
月亮会是什么
海蜇喜欢吃什么？

09:51.280 --> 09:53.558
Both: Cheese.
两者：奶酪。

09:55.836 --> 09:57.769
- Hmm?
- 唔？

09:57.838 --> 09:59.737
[slurps]
[啜饮]

10:06.226 --> 10:10.092
- Freeze, moon jelly.
- 冷冻吧，月亮果冻。

10:10.161 --> 10:13.785
- Prepare to be caught.
- 做好被抓住的准备。

10:13.854 --> 10:16.788
Huh?
啊？

10:16.857 --> 10:18.894
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

10:18.963 --> 10:20.585
- We're losing the light.
- 我们正在失去光明。

10:20.654 --> 10:22.967
The moon jelly's
going to disappear.
月光果冻的
将会消失。

10:23.036 --> 10:25.625
- Losing the light, you say?
- Huh?
- 你说失去光明？
- 啊？

10:25.694 --> 10:30.422
Maybe you could use
a little moonlight.
也许你可以使用
一点月光。

10:31.872 --> 10:34.772
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

10:34.841 --> 10:37.533
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:37.602 --> 10:42.055
[together]
Meep, meep, meep.
[一起]
米普，米普，米普。

10:42.124 --> 10:44.678
- Look, it's working!
- 看，它起作用了！

10:44.747 --> 10:49.545
- We need more moonlight!
- 我们需要更多的月光！

10:49.614 --> 10:51.651
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

10:53.204 --> 10:54.826
- Huh?
- 啊？

10:54.895 --> 10:57.070
- Ahh!
- 啊！

10:57.139 --> 10:59.072
Gah!
- Hyah!
嘎！
- 哈！

10:59.141 --> 11:00.142
- We caught him.
- 我们抓住了他。

11:00.211 --> 11:01.764
We did it, Kevin.
我们做到了，凯文。

11:01.833 --> 11:03.939
We did it.
我们做到了。

11:04.008 --> 11:05.009
Whoa!
哇！

11:05.078 --> 11:06.217
- Sorry, SpongeBob.
- 对不起，海绵宝宝。

11:06.286 --> 11:08.564
But there's no we about it.
但没有我们的事。

11:08.633 --> 11:12.085
I'm the sole catcher
of the moon jellyfish.
我是唯一的捕手
月亮水母的。

11:12.154 --> 11:15.847
[laughs]
[笑]

11:15.916 --> 11:17.124
Wha?
Wait a minute.
世界卫生大会？
等一下。

11:17.193 --> 11:19.782
Where are we going?
Where are you taking me?
我们要去哪里？
你要带我去哪里？

11:19.851 --> 11:21.784
[screams]
[尖叫声]

11:21.853 --> 11:23.717
[together]
Ooh.
[一起]
哦。

11:23.786 --> 11:25.270
- Wow.
- 哇。

11:25.339 --> 11:27.894
- Where's the moon jelly going?
- 月光果冻去哪儿了？

11:27.963 --> 11:29.585
- Home, Patrick.
- 回家，帕特里克。

11:29.654 --> 11:30.828
Home.
家。

11:30.897 --> 11:33.278
Until it comes back
in 25 years, that is.
直到它回来
25年后，也就是说。

11:33.347 --> 11:36.730
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

11:42.149 --> 11:44.289
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

11:44.358 --> 11:47.741
- I hate jellyfishing.
- 我讨厌捕水母。

11:50.330 --> 11:53.229
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:53.298 --> 11:59.649
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:59.719 --> 12:01.065
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

12:01.134 --> 12:05.172
OK, Sandy, your surprise is
just a few more steps away.
好吧，桑迪，你的惊喜是
再走几步。

12:05.241 --> 12:07.140
- Gosh, fellas,
I can't wait to...
- 天哪，伙计们，
我等不及...

12:07.209 --> 12:09.763
both: Surprise!
两人：惊喜！

12:09.832 --> 12:13.629
- [gasps] The Museum of
Bikini Bottom History!
- [喘气] 博物馆
比基尼泳裤的历史！

12:13.698 --> 12:16.114
How'd y'all know
to take me here?
你们怎么知道的
带我来这里？

12:16.183 --> 12:18.289
- You gave us these invitations.
- 你给了我们这些邀请。

12:18.358 --> 12:19.911
- Bleh-ehh.
- 哎呀。

12:19.980 --> 12:21.913
- And boy am I glad I did.
- 我很高兴我这么做了。

12:21.982 --> 12:25.365
I'm just itching to learn
all about the rich history
我只是渴望学习
关于丰富的历史

12:25.434 --> 12:27.056
of Bikini Bottom.
的比基尼底部。

12:27.125 --> 12:29.231
And I will be taking notes.
我会做笔记。

12:29.300 --> 12:30.922
My research
is going to be featured
我的研究
将会被推荐

12:30.991 --> 12:35.099
in a scientific journal,
"The Naval Gazette."
在一本科学杂志上，
《海军公报》。

12:35.168 --> 12:38.688
- I love gazing at my navel.
- 我喜欢凝视我的肚脐。

12:38.758 --> 12:40.207
Hi.
你好。

12:40.276 --> 12:43.038
Well, what are we waiting for?
那么，我们还等什么？

12:43.107 --> 12:45.074
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

12:45.143 --> 12:47.801
- Tickets, please.
- 请买票。

12:47.870 --> 12:52.461
- Here you go.
- 干得好。

12:52.530 --> 12:54.497
- [groans] Let's see here.
- [呻吟] 让我们看看这里。

12:54.566 --> 13:00.055
One, two... gee,
I lost my place.
一、二……哎呀，
我失去了我的位置。

13:00.124 --> 13:01.815
- Look, the first artifact.
- 看，第一件神器。

13:01.884 --> 13:06.751
Bikini Bottom's
oldest security guard.
比基尼泳裤
最年长的保安。

13:06.820 --> 13:10.928
- They should dust
these old robots.
- 他们应该除尘
这些老机器人。

13:10.997 --> 13:13.482
- Hey, can't you read?
- 嘿，你不会读书吗？

13:13.551 --> 13:16.105
It says no touching.
说的是不能碰。

13:16.174 --> 13:17.244
- [laughs]
- [笑]

13:17.313 --> 13:19.902
Sorry.
对不起。

13:19.971 --> 13:20.971
- All right, youngsters.
- 好吧，年轻人。

13:21.007 --> 13:22.111
In you go.
你进去吧。

13:22.180 --> 13:23.630
Now, don't cause any trouble,
现在，不要惹任何麻烦，

13:23.699 --> 13:25.735
or you'll have to answer to me.
否则你就得回答我。

13:25.805 --> 13:27.876
[laughs]
[笑]

13:27.945 --> 13:29.947
Hello?
你好？

13:30.016 --> 13:31.845
[snoring]
[打鼾]

13:31.914 --> 13:35.297
- Welcome to the ancient
past before Bikini
- 欢迎来到远古
比基尼之前的过去

13:35.366 --> 13:37.437
Bottom was Bikini Bottom.
下装是比基尼下装。

13:37.506 --> 13:39.439
They say the exhibits
here date back
他们说展品
这里追溯到

13:39.508 --> 13:42.304
at least one gazillion years.
至少有亿万年。

13:42.373 --> 13:44.858
- Uh, you sure about that math?
- 呃，你确定数学吗？

13:44.927 --> 13:47.033
- Uh, they do math good.
- 呃，他们数学学得很好。

13:49.863 --> 13:50.863
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

13:50.899 --> 13:52.245
Look here, fellas.
看这里，伙计们。

13:52.314 --> 13:54.903
Millions of years ago,
this here land
数百万年前，
这片土地

13:54.972 --> 13:57.146
was called Bikini Top.
被称为比基尼上衣。

13:57.215 --> 14:02.013
The elevation was lowered
due to natural erosion.
海拔降低了
由于自然侵蚀。

14:02.082 --> 14:03.152
- [scoffs]
- [嘲笑]

14:03.221 --> 14:05.292
That's not how it happened.
事情并非如此。

14:05.361 --> 14:06.535
- Don't worry, Sandy.
- 别担心，桑迪。

14:06.604 --> 14:08.813
We'll tell you the true story.
我们会告诉你真实的故事。

14:08.882 --> 14:12.852
- Yeah.
It goes like this.
- 是的。
事情是这样的。

14:12.921 --> 14:16.096
A gazillion years
ago, Bikini Top
亿万年
前，比基尼上衣

14:16.165 --> 14:19.306
was hit by a humongous anchor.
被一个巨大的锚击中。

14:19.375 --> 14:21.861
- The anchor flattened
the hill to the bottom
- 锚变平
山到山脚

14:21.930 --> 14:24.967
of the ocean, which is why
it's called Bikini Bottom.
海洋的存在，这就是为什么
它被称为比基尼泳裤。

14:25.036 --> 14:28.177
- And then the
anchor was so heavy
- 然后是
锚是如此重

14:28.246 --> 14:32.975
that a bunch of buildings got
popped up out of the ground.
一堆建筑物
从地里冒出来。

14:33.044 --> 14:36.427
[hawk cawing]
[鹰叫]

14:36.496 --> 14:39.085
- Ah!
- Ooh!
- 啊！
- 哦！

14:40.189 --> 14:43.883
- Bikini Bottom.
- 比基尼下装。

14:43.952 --> 14:50.544
[both hooting]
[双方齐鸣]

14:50.613 --> 14:52.892
- You mean to tell me
the very anchor
- 你是想告诉我
锚

14:52.961 --> 14:55.549
we're standing
inside now is the one
我们站着
现在里面就是那个

14:55.618 --> 14:57.655
that created Bikini Bottom?
创造了比基尼泳裤？

14:57.724 --> 15:00.347
Both:
Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh.
两者：
嗯嗯嗯嗯。

15:02.487 --> 15:03.419
- Yup.
- 是的。

15:03.488 --> 15:06.871
I see.
我懂了。

15:06.940 --> 15:08.597
[elevator dings]
[电梯叮叮声]

15:08.666 --> 15:10.702
Looks like this
floor covers Bikini
看起来像这样
地板套 比基尼

15:10.771 --> 15:14.154
Bottom's old pioneer days.
底部的老拓荒者时代。

15:14.223 --> 15:15.259
- Wow.
- 哇。

15:15.328 --> 15:17.502
A genuine antique rock.
真正的古董岩石。

15:17.571 --> 15:20.885
The pioneers used to ride
these babies for miles.
拓荒者们曾经骑过
这些婴儿绵延数英里。

15:20.954 --> 15:23.370
- I want to try.
- 我想尝试一下。

15:23.439 --> 15:27.202
Giddyup.
吉迪普。

15:27.271 --> 15:28.134
[rock neighing]
[岩石嘶鸣]

15:28.203 --> 15:29.204
Whoa.
哇哦。

15:29.273 --> 15:31.965
Hey, calm down.
嘿，冷静点。

15:32.034 --> 15:34.554
- I gotcha.
- 我明白了。

15:34.623 --> 15:36.556
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

15:36.625 --> 15:40.249
- Whoo-hoo!
Yippee-yo-ki-yay.
- 呼呼！
Yippee-yo-ki-yay。

15:40.318 --> 15:45.358
- Hey, no trick ropin'.
- 嘿，没有什么花招。

15:45.427 --> 15:47.118
Darn hooligans.
该死的流氓。

15:47.187 --> 15:48.085
[rock neighing]
[岩石嘶鸣]

15:48.154 --> 15:49.189
Oh!
哦！

15:49.258 --> 15:53.504
- Heh-heh-heh.
Sorry, sir.
- 嘿嘿嘿。
对不起，先生。

15:53.573 --> 15:56.817
- Look, Sandy,
in the old days, the pioneers
- 看，桑迪，
过去，先驱者们

15:56.886 --> 16:00.235
used to milk dairy urchins
on their homesteads.
用于给海胆挤奶
在他们的家园。

16:00.304 --> 16:02.271
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

16:02.340 --> 16:05.688
It was a simple, honest life
without an ounce of greed.
这是一种简单而诚实的生活
没有一丝贪婪。

16:05.757 --> 16:08.277
- Another full pail, Bessie.
- 又满一桶，贝西。

16:08.346 --> 16:11.453
I reckon I can barter
for quite a bit with this.
我想我可以以物易物
对此已经有相当多的时间了。

16:11.522 --> 16:13.627
[chuckles]
Ah!
[笑声]
啊！

16:13.696 --> 16:16.803
Maybe for some thicker gloves.
也许需要一些更厚的手套。

16:16.872 --> 16:19.392
- But the pioneers
have to watch out
- 但是先驱们
必须要小心

16:19.461 --> 16:21.773
for those dirty, stinky outlaws.
对于那些又脏又臭的不法之徒。

16:21.842 --> 16:24.086
- [gasps] Oh, no.
- [喘气]哦，不。

16:24.155 --> 16:25.985
It's the Grungy Gang.
这是蹩脚帮。

16:26.054 --> 16:29.264
Oh, I knew something
smelled fishy.
哦，我知道了一些事情
闻起来有鱼腥味。

16:29.333 --> 16:31.645
- [cackles]
- [咯咯笑]

16:31.714 --> 16:35.132
We're here to take
that valuable little urchin
我们来这里是为了带走
那个可贵的小顽童

16:35.201 --> 16:36.823
off your hands.
离开你的手。

16:36.892 --> 16:37.962
Er, claws.
呃，爪子。

16:38.031 --> 16:41.828
- Not so fast,
you filthy felons.
- 没那么快，
你们这些肮脏的重罪犯。

16:41.897 --> 16:45.349
- Fortunately, Sheriff Pants
and Deputy Star brought
- 幸运的是，警长裤
和副星带来了

16:45.418 --> 16:47.868
law and order to the land.
法律和秩序的土地。

16:47.937 --> 16:50.595
We're here to clean up your act.
我们来这里是为了纠正你的行为。

16:50.664 --> 16:52.459
- Get 'em, boys.
- 抓住他们，孩子们。

16:52.528 --> 16:55.669
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

16:59.294 --> 17:01.365
- Huh?
- 啊？

17:01.434 --> 17:04.333
- Huh?
- 啊？

17:04.402 --> 17:05.921
- Aw, bubbles.
- 噢，泡泡。

17:05.990 --> 17:08.820
- And with law came commerce.
- 伴随着法律而来的是商业。

17:08.889 --> 17:13.618
- Thus Bikini Bottom's
first restaurant was opened.
- 因此比基尼泳裤
第一家餐厅开业。

17:14.826 --> 17:17.760
The Krusty Kreamery.
库斯蒂·克里默里。

17:19.624 --> 17:22.524
[both slurping]
[两人都发出咕噜声]

17:24.698 --> 17:27.460
- Care for some souvenir milk?
- 想要一些纪念牛奶吗？

17:27.529 --> 17:28.909
- I'm not thirsty.
- 我不渴。

17:28.978 --> 17:31.533
Thanks.
- Suit yourself.
谢谢。
- 适合你自己。

17:31.602 --> 17:34.225
[gulping]
[吞咽]

17:34.294 --> 17:35.295
Ahh.
啊。

17:35.364 --> 17:37.884
[elevator dings]
[电梯叮叮声]

17:37.953 --> 17:40.887
- I reckon we've stepped
into Bikini Bottom's
- 我想我们已经迈出了一步
进入比基尼泳裤

17:40.956 --> 17:43.855
Industrial Revolution era.
工业革命时代。

17:43.924 --> 17:45.029
Wow.
哇。

17:45.098 --> 17:47.273
A Model C Boat?
C型船？

17:47.342 --> 17:49.171
Says here... ahh!
说到这里……啊！

17:49.240 --> 17:51.000
- Don't read that, Sandy.
- 别读那个，桑迪。

17:51.070 --> 17:55.246
We'll tell you the real story.
我们会告诉你真实的故事。

17:55.315 --> 17:56.937
SpongeBob, what's the story?
海绵宝宝，故事是什么？

17:57.006 --> 18:01.010
- Well, Bikini Bottom's own
titan of industry, Mr. Puff,
- 嗯，比基尼泳裤自己的
工业巨头普夫先生，

18:01.080 --> 18:04.600
ran the first successful
boat assembly line.
第一次跑成功了
船装配线。

18:06.671 --> 18:08.397
[horn honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

18:08.466 --> 18:10.917
It was important for
every worker to perform
这对于
每个工人都要执行

18:10.986 --> 18:12.746
as efficiently as possible.
尽可能高效。

18:12.815 --> 18:15.784
[horns honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

18:20.823 --> 18:21.824
[whistle blows]
[哨声响起]

18:21.893 --> 18:23.999
- Speed up line number five.
- 加快第五行的速度。

18:24.068 --> 18:27.623
Both:
Speeding up line number five.
两者：
加快五号线的速度。

18:27.692 --> 18:28.797
- Huh?
- 啊？

18:28.866 --> 18:32.111
[horns honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

18:32.180 --> 18:34.113
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

18:34.182 --> 18:37.530
- Eh, eh... ahh!
- 呃，呃……啊！

18:37.599 --> 18:40.671
- Sometimes they'd get
a little too caught up
- 有时他们会得到
有点太着迷了

18:40.740 --> 18:42.259
in their work.
在他们的工作中。

18:42.328 --> 18:44.985
Watch this.
注意这个。

18:45.054 --> 18:46.539
- Whee!
- 呼！

18:46.608 --> 18:48.920
[babbling]
[胡说]

18:48.989 --> 18:50.612
Whoa.
哇哦。

18:52.303 --> 18:54.202
- Oof!
- Ohh!
- 噢！
- 哦！

18:54.271 --> 18:56.376
But being a shrewd
industrialist,
但作为一个精明的人
实业家,

18:56.445 --> 18:59.931
Mr. Puff also owned
the hospital next door.
普夫先生还拥有
隔壁的医院。

19:06.110 --> 19:07.560
- Beep, beep.
- 嘟嘟，嘟嘟。

19:07.629 --> 19:09.665
- Now hold it just
a darn minute.
- 现在握住它
该死的一分钟。

19:12.427 --> 19:13.980
- [laughs]
- [笑]

19:14.049 --> 19:17.190
- Ain't no way these
screwball stories are true.
- 这些都不是办法
荒唐的故事是真的。

19:17.259 --> 19:18.743
Let me read that plaque.
让我读一下那块牌匾。

19:18.812 --> 19:20.435
"Titan of industry."
“工业巨头”。

19:20.504 --> 19:21.504
"Assembly line."
“流水线。”

19:21.539 --> 19:22.540
"Injuries."
“受伤。”

19:22.609 --> 19:24.059
"Hospital next door."
“隔壁的医院。”

19:24.128 --> 19:25.302
"Beep beep"?
“嘟嘟”？

19:25.371 --> 19:27.511
Well, twist my tail.
好吧，扭动我的尾巴。

19:27.580 --> 19:29.720
Y'all were right.
你们都是对的。

19:29.789 --> 19:30.997
- Told ya.
- 告诉过你了。

19:31.066 --> 19:33.033
Beep beep.
嘟嘟嘟。

19:34.897 --> 19:37.521
- I knew Bikini Bottom's
history would be colorful,
- 我知道比基尼泳裤
历史将是丰富多彩的，

19:37.590 --> 19:40.972
but I'm starting to have
more questions than answers.
但我开始有
问题多于答案。

19:41.041 --> 19:43.043
- Maybe this question
mark on the top floor
- 也许这个问题
在顶楼做标记

19:43.112 --> 19:45.011
is where you get your
questions answered.
是你得到你的地方
问题得到解答。

19:45.080 --> 19:48.048
- You forgot to push these.
- 你忘了推这些。

19:50.810 --> 19:51.742
[elevator dings]
[电梯叮叮声]

19:51.811 --> 19:53.019
[rock music]
[摇滚乐]

19:53.088 --> 19:57.334
- Psychedelic Sea era.
- 迷幻海洋时代。

19:57.403 --> 19:58.680
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

19:58.749 --> 20:01.752
Deep Disco era.
深度迪斯科时代。

20:01.821 --> 20:02.753
[electronic music]
[电子音乐]

20:02.822 --> 20:06.412
New Wave Nitwits era.
新浪潮白痴时代。

20:06.481 --> 20:07.413
[bouncy upbeat music]
[欢快欢快的音乐]

20:07.482 --> 20:11.727
Nautical Nonsense era.
航海废话时代。

20:11.796 --> 20:13.833
- This sure is a weird museum.
- 这确实是一个奇怪的博物馆。

20:13.902 --> 20:15.386
[elevator dings]
[电梯叮叮声]

20:18.493 --> 20:19.735
- Huh.
- 嗯。

20:19.804 --> 20:22.393
I guess this
is the ghost exhibit.
我猜这个
是鬼魂展览。

20:22.462 --> 20:24.568
- I think it's under
construction, Patrick.
- 我认为它在下面
建筑，帕特里克.

20:24.637 --> 20:26.052
- Oh.
- 哦。

20:26.121 --> 20:28.434
I can't wait till they
put the ghosts in.
我等不及他们了
把鬼魂放进去。

20:28.503 --> 20:29.503
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

20:29.538 --> 20:30.574
Wait a second.
等一下。

20:30.643 --> 20:33.646
Is this a denture applicator?
这是假牙涂抹器吗？

20:33.715 --> 20:36.407
[machine chomping]
【机器咀嚼】

20:36.476 --> 20:39.893
Orthopedic jet boots.
矫形喷气靴。

20:39.962 --> 20:42.758
The atomic adult diaper ray.
原子成人尿布射线。

20:42.827 --> 20:46.003
Whoa!
哇！

20:46.072 --> 20:48.074
Both: We're adults.
两人：我们都是成年人了。

20:48.143 --> 20:50.318
[laughter]
[笑声]

20:50.387 --> 20:51.905
- What in tarnation?
- 塔尼翁什么？

20:51.974 --> 20:54.943
[gasps] This ain't no regular
future, fellas.
[喘气]这不是常规的
未来，伙计们。

20:55.012 --> 20:58.395
This is a future ruled
by Old Man Walker!
这是一个被统治的未来
作者：老沃克！

20:58.464 --> 20:59.948
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

21:00.017 --> 21:03.123
[statue crumbling]
[雕像倒塌]

21:03.192 --> 21:05.678
- That's right, you hooligans.
- 没错，你们这些流氓。

21:05.747 --> 21:08.543
I said no touching!
我说了不许碰！

21:08.612 --> 21:10.027
[together]
Sorry.
[一起]
抱歉。

21:11.718 --> 21:14.411
[shuddering]
[颤抖]

21:14.480 --> 21:20.555
- You three have seen too much,
and now I'm going to get ya.
- 你们三个看太多了，
现在我要去找你了。

21:20.624 --> 21:22.419
Stay right there.
呆在那里。

21:22.488 --> 21:23.489
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

21:23.558 --> 21:24.490
- Run!
- 跑步！

21:24.559 --> 21:26.871
[yelling]
[大喊]

21:37.986 --> 21:39.367
- Please, Old Man Walker.
- 拜托，老沃克。

21:39.436 --> 21:41.783
We won't tell nobody
about the future.
我们不会告诉任何人
关于未来。

21:41.852 --> 21:45.787
- Hey, everybody,
we've seen the future,
- 嘿，大家，
我们已经看到了未来，

21:45.856 --> 21:48.755
but it's a secret.
但这是一个秘密。

21:48.824 --> 21:51.275
Shh.
嘘。

21:51.344 --> 21:53.553
[loud rumbling]
[巨响]

21:53.622 --> 21:54.761
[all gasping]
[全都喘气]

21:56.556 --> 21:57.799
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

21:57.868 --> 22:00.180
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

22:03.287 --> 22:07.498
- Old Man Walker
will rule you all.
- 老沃克
将统治你们所有人。

22:09.776 --> 22:11.813
- Well,
there goes Bikini Bottom's
- 嗯，
比基尼泳裤就在那里

22:11.882 --> 22:14.263
entire past and future.
整个过去和未来。

22:14.333 --> 22:16.714
- So, Sandy, what'd you think?
- 那么，桑迪，你觉得怎么样？

22:16.783 --> 22:18.544
- I'm still skeptical.
- 我仍然持怀疑态度。

22:18.613 --> 22:21.512
Bikini Bottom's
past was a bit too nuts
比基尼泳裤
过去有点太疯狂了

22:21.581 --> 22:23.065
for this old squirrel.
为了这只老松鼠。

22:23.134 --> 22:26.828
- But hey, at least Bikini
Bottom is normal now.
- 但是嘿，至少比基尼
现在底部已经正常了。

22:26.897 --> 22:28.347
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

22:28.416 --> 22:32.868
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

22:32.937 --> 22:35.871
- Yep, totally normal.
- 是的，完全正常。

22:35.940 --> 22:39.940
- Yep, totally normal.
- 是的，完全正常。

- 是的，完全正常。